                        <a href="https://www.navapbc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dotted-link">Nava</a> and Verdance have worked as partners on federal technology projects since 2021. Since then, we've built intuitive software to help millions of beneficiaries enroll in critical services, and we've modernized complex legacy systems and operations — all in service of a future where government digital services are high-quality and simple to access by default.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Our joint venture will accelerate our shared mission of improving government services by combining Verdance's AI fluency, healthcare experience, and legislative branch expertise with Nava's 12+ years of delivering large-scale, human-centered modernization of critical government services.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        We're proud to be participating in the Small Business Administration's Mentor-Protégé Program, and thrilled to work together in a long-term partnership to deliver public benefit. The Nava-Verdance JV holds a GSA Multiple Award Schedule contract award and qualifies for small business set-aside MAS task orders.
                    </p>
